    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25136" root="صوب" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُصَابَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Syn. with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِصَابَةٌ</span>: (K, TA:) see 4, latter
half. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُصِيبَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَرَكْتُ النَّاسَ عَلَى</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُصَابَاتِهِمْ</span> is a saying mentioned by Ibn-Buzurj, as
meaning [<i>I left the people</i> disposed, or placed,]
<i>according to their classes,</i> or <i>ranks.</i> (TA.)

